      }
    },
    "스냅샷을 뜨는 동안 rekordbox 라이브러리가 바뀌어 그 스냅샷은 버렸습니다. rekordbox를 종료한 채로 다시 누르세요" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The rekordbox library changed while the restore point was being created, so it was discarded. Keep rekordbox closed and try again."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
